-- Owner, 21 Sep 2026: (1) every business gets a Google Maps link for now, a Maps search for its
-- name and address, until the owner pastes their own from Edit profile; (2) Market pickup places
-- drop area names and are stored as city + PIN code like every other place. The app shows only the
-- city; the PIN code is used internally for what is near you.
-- Snapshot: supabase/dumps/2026-09-21-before-maps-and-pickups.sql
